  "document": {
    "schema_version": 1,
    "diagram_type": "explainer",
    "meta": {
      "title": "源目录末尾的 `/`，差哪一层？",
      "id": "slash",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "style": "editorial"
    },
    "answer": {
      "summary": "目标目录 `dst` 已存在且为空时，`src` 会把自己那一层也复制进去，得到 `dst/src/`；`src/` 则把内容直接放进 `dst/`。两者都会复制子目录。[](source:manual)",
      "scope": "Apple openrsync · 本地 -r 复制 · 空目标目录"
    },
    "panels": [
      {
        "id": "source",
        "title": "从相同的源目录开始",
        "span": 6,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "两个例子分开运行，每次都使用这三份源文件和一个空 `dst`。[](source:probe)",
            "id": "prose-3bbf259e9455"
          },
          {
            "type": "snippet",
            "language": "text",
            "title": "复制前的文件路径",
            "text": "src/.hidden\nsrc/a.txt\nsrc/nested/b.txt",
            "id": "snippet-672c0efcbc7a"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "without-slash",
        "title": "不带 `/`：保留外层 src",
        "span": 6,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "snippet",
            "language": "sh",
            "title": "复制源目录本身",
            "text": "rsync -r -- src dst",
            "id": "snippet-0d1c40a76363"
          },
          {
            "type": "snippet",
            "language": "text",
            "title": "复制后的目标目录",
            "text": "dst/\n└── src/\n    ├── .hidden\n    ├── a.txt\n    └── nested/\n        └── b.txt",
            "id": "snippet-e852912cb9ca"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "`src` 这一层进入了 `dst`；嵌套文件位于 `dst/src/nested/b.txt`。[](source:probe)",
            "id": "prose-3da8e9834373"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "with-slash",
        "title": "带 `/`：内容直接进入 dst",
        "span": 6,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "snippet",
            "language": "sh",
            "title": "复制源目录里的内容",
            "text": "rsync -r -- src/ dst",
            "id": "snippet-56b5f5172e83"
          },
          {
            "type": "snippet",
            "language": "text",
            "title": "复制后的目标目录",
            "text": "dst/\n├── .hidden\n├── a.txt\n└── nested/\n    └── b.txt",
            "id": "snippet-a7a6e8d62e92"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "`-r` 仍然递归复制，嵌套文件位于 `dst/nested/b.txt`。末尾的 `/` 没有关闭递归，隐藏文件也仍在。[](source:manual)[](source:probe)",
            "id": "prose-a6f68e98bb03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "scope",
        "title": "这次实测的范围",
        "span": 12,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "使用 macOS 的 Apple openrsync（项目 `rsync-184`）做本地复制。两次命令都成功退出，源文件保持不变。目标目录不存在时，手册说明会创建它；本次探针也得到相同的两种目录层级。[](source:destination)[](source:probe)",
            "id": "prose-9b409713d952"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "结果针对单个源目录和 `-r`；过滤规则、符号链接、远程传输和元数据不在这次检查范围内。",
            "id": "prose-834df2de11ce"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "sources": [
      {
        "id": "manual",
        "title": "Apple openrsync 手册：递归与源目录末尾斜杠",
        "url": "https://github.com/apple-oss-distributions/rsync/blob/13eacd7e9a204b236310dab23682f6354ecc69bd/openrsync/openrsync.1#L760-L773"
      },
      {
        "id": "destination",
        "title": "Apple openrsync 手册：目标目录",
        "url": "https://github.com/apple-oss-distributions/rsync/blob/13eacd7e9a204b236310dab23682f6354ecc69bd/openrsync/openrsync.1#L972-L981"
      },
      {
        "id": "probe",
        "title": "本地目录与文件内容记录",
        "path": "source/probe-1.json"
      }
    ]
  },
